+LOST & FOUND RESALE INTERIORS
+
+Local Delivery & Consignor Pickup ΓÇö Staff Pricing Cheat Sheet
+
+Same pricing rules for Local Arizona Delivery and Consignor Pickup. Customers see truck-adjusted drive time (mapped
+route + 3 min local truck travel), miles, and preliminary estimate. Raw Google/car minutes are never shown.
+
+Core formula
+
+FINAL = (route + multi-item + large + heavy) ├ù trucks + stairs + assembly
+
+Rate & base route
+
+Item                       Rule
+Base price                 $95 covers ~15 min one-way truck time (round-trip billing)
+Standard rate label        billed at 95/hr
+3-person crew rate         billed at 130/hr ΓÇö see oversize crew rules below
+Two trucks                 billed at 95/hr ┬╖ two trucks (2├ù route-side adders)
+Truck time shown           Google mapped time + 3 min (local truck travel)
+Distance shown             Mapped miles (unchanged)
+
+Truck time !ΓÇÖ price (one-way truck minutes)
+
+Google (car)         Truck time shown  Typical route price
+12 min               15 min            $95
+14 min               17 min            $100
+16 min               19 min            $105
+22 min               25 min            $115
+
+Customer fine print: "Distance is based on the mapped route. Drive time includes local truck travel time and is not live traffic."
+
+Piece surcharges (local delivery + pickup only)
+
+Surcharge            When                                         Amount
+
+Multi-item           3rd piece and up (first 2 included in base)  +$5 if footprint "d 24├ù24 in ┬╖ +$10 if bigger
+Large piece          Any piece ΓÇö width, depth, OR height > 60 in  +$10 per piece
+Heavy piece          Any piece ΓÇö weight > 300 lb                  +$10 per piece
+Stairs               After 1st flight                             +$7 per additional flight
+
+ ΓÇó Large and heavy apply to every qualifying piece, including the 1st and 2nd.
+ ΓÇó Multi-item only starts on the 3rd piece.
+ ΓÇó A piece can stack surcharges (e.g. large sofa + heavy safe = +$20 on that piece).
+
+Disassembly & reassembly (local delivery + pickup)
+
+Asked on the local/pickup form (job-level). First 15 minutes of disassembly/reassembly with wrapping/prep is included in the
+base route ΓÇö no extra charge. Only minutes entered BEYOND that 15 are billable.
+Local Delivery & Pickup Pricing
+
+Customer answers                       Price         What customer sees
+
+No                                     $0            Nothing extra
+
+Not sure                               $0            Treated as no for pricing
+Yes !ΓÇÖ within 15 min
+                                       $0            Needed ΓÇö within 15 min with wrapping/prep (no extra charge)
+
+Yes !ΓÇÖ over 15 min !ΓÇÖ No               $0            Required, but no extra time billed
+
+Yes !ΓÇÖ over 15 min !ΓÇÖ Not sure         $0            Required, no extra time billed
+
+Yes !ΓÇÖ over 15 min !ΓÇÖ Yes + X extra min Fee on X Additional X min ┬╖ Total (15+X) min
+
+Extra minutes > 60                     only
+                                       Fee applies Red note: confirm time with customer
+
+                                       + staff flag
+
+Assembly fee formula: extra minutes only (beyond included 15) ├ù ($95 ├╖ 60 per minute), rounded up to nearest $5. Does
+
+NOT add to route/drive minutes.
+
+ ΓÇó 20 extra minutes !ΓÇÖ $35 assembly fee (15 min route $95 !ΓÇÖ total $130)
+ ΓÇó 75 extra minutes !ΓÇÖ $120 assembly fee + manual review to confirm with customer
+ ΓÇó Assembly fee is added AFTER the truck multiplier (not doubled on two-truck jobs).
+Customer email shows minutes only for assembly ΓÇö not a separate dollar line for the assembly fee (fee is in the total).
+
+Stairs
+
+Flights of stairs                Stair fee
+1 flight                         $0 (included)
+2 flights                        +$7
+3 flights                        +$14
+4 flights                        +$21
+
+ ΓÇó Stairs fee is added after truck multiplier (not doubled on two-truck jobs).
+
+Extra crew & two trucks
+
+Customer selects                       Route rate                               Multiplier
+
+Standard (2 movers)                    billed at 95/hr                          ├ù1 truck
+1 extra person (3 total)               billed at 130/hr                         ├ù1 truck
+2 extra people (4 total)               billed at 95/hr ┬╖ two trucks             ├ù2 trucks on route + multi + large + heavy
+
+ ΓÇó Customer must explain why extra crew is needed (form validation).
+ ΓÇó Oversize items (299+ lb & over 72 in H, or 450+ lb) auto-use $130/hr even if customer did not select extra crew.
+
+Out-of-town / long haul (still local truck)
+
+ ΓÇó Round trip over 100 miles !ΓÇÖ route priced at 80% of $95/hr (~$76/hr effective).
+ ΓÇó Label may say ΓÇ£Best-Guess Estimate (Out of town ΓÇö callout)ΓÇ¥ ΓÇö confirm before scheduling.
+ ΓÇó If 2 extra people on a long-haul job: two trucks at the reduced 80% rate.
+
+What doubles on two-truck jobs vs what does not
+
+Component                       ├ù2 trucks?           Notes
+                                                     Based on drive time at applicable hourly rate
+Route price                     Yes                  Added before multiplier
+                                                     Added once after multiplier
+Multi-item / large / heavy adders Yes                Added once after multiplier
+
+Stair fee                       No
+
+Assembly fee                    No
+Local Delivery & Pickup Pricing
+
+Manual review flags (may not auto-add $)
+
+These flag staff for follow-up. Estimate still generates but team should confirm:
+ ΓÇó Stairs, extra crew, oversize 3-person crew, assembly over 60 extra minutes
+ ΓÇó Freight elevator ┬╖ tight turns / narrow halls ┬╖ long carry
+ ΓÇó Fragile / special handling ┬╖ parking or time restrictions ┬╖ gated access
+ ΓÇó One-way drive over ~75 minutes ┬╖ out-of-town 100+ mile round trip
+
+3-person crew ($130/hr) ΓÇö separate from +$10 surcharges
+
+ ΓÇó 299+ lb AND over 72 in height, OR
+ ΓÇó 450+ lb (any height).
+Wide sofas alone do not trigger 3-person crew unless weight/height rules apply.
+
+Examples ΓÇö delivery & pickup (same math)
+
+  Example 1 ΓÇö Simple nearby job
+  1 chair ┬╖ 20├ù20├ù36 ┬╖ 25 lb ┬╖ ~15 min truck time
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Multi $0 ┬╖ Large $0 ┬╖ Heavy $0 !ΓÇÖ Total $95
+  Shows: Preliminary Estimate $95 ┬╖ billed at 95/hr
+
+  Example 2 ΓÇö Three small items
+  3 side tables ┬╖ each 20├ù20├ù24 ┬╖ ~15 min truck
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Multi +$5 (3rd piece, small) !ΓÇÖ Total $100
+
+  Example 3 ΓÇö One sofa (large dimension)
+  1 sofa ┬╖ 84├ù36├ù34 ┬╖ 180 lb ┬╖ ~15 min truck
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Large +$10 (width > 60 in) !ΓÇÖ Total $105
+
+  Example 4 ΓÇö Heavy dresser
+  1 dresser ┬╖ 40├ù20├ù34 ┬╖ 320 lb ┬╖ ~15 min truck
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Heavy +$10 !ΓÇÖ Total $105
+
+  Example 5 ΓÇö Armoire (large + heavy + 3-person crew)
+  1 armoire ┬╖ 40├ù24├ù80 ┬╖ 450 lb ┬╖ ~15 min truck
+  Route $130 (3-person) ┬╖ Large +$10 ┬╖ Heavy +$10 !ΓÇÖ Total $150
+  Shows: billed at 130/hr
+
+  Example 6 ΓÇö Farther address + multi-item
+  3 small chairs ┬╖ Google ~19 min car !ΓÇÖ truck 22 min
+  Route ~$110 ┬╖ Multi +$5 (3rd chair) !ΓÇÖ Total $115
+  Customer sees ~22 min each way (not 19).
+
+  Example 7 ΓÇö Stairs
+  1 chair ┬╖ ~15 min ┬╖ 3 flights of stairs
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Stairs +$14 (2 extra flights ├ù $7) !ΓÇÖ Total $109
+Local Delivery & Pickup Pricing
+
+  Example 8 ΓÇö Busy delivery (4 pieces)
+  22 min truck ┬╖ 2 flights of stairs
+  2 small decor (16├ù16) ΓÇö in base
+  1 table 66├ù40 ΓÇö multi +$10, large +$10
+  1 cabinet 36├ù24├ù74 ┬╖ 310 lb ΓÇö multi +$10, large +$10, heavy +$10
+  Route $110 ┬╖ Multi +$20 ┬╖ Large +$20 ┬╖ Heavy +$10 ┬╖ Stairs +$7 !ΓÇÖ Total $167
+
+  Example 9 ΓÇö Two-truck job
+  2 large sofas ┬╖ ~15 min ┬╖ 2 extra people / two trucks
+  (Route $95 + large +$10 + large +$10) ├ù 2 trucks !ΓÇÖ Total $230
+  Shows: billed at 95/hr ┬╖ two trucks
+
+  Example 10 ΓÇö Disassembly within 15 min (no charge)
+  1 bed frame ┬╖ ~15 min ┬╖ Assembly: Yes, within 15 min
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Assembly $0 !ΓÇÖ Total $95
+  Customer sees: disassembly needed ΓÇö within 15 min, no extra charge.
+
+  Example 11 ΓÇö Disassembly over 15 min (+20 extra minutes)
+  1 armoire ┬╖ ~15 min ┬╖ Assembly: Yes, over 15 min, 20 extra minutes entered
+  Route $95 ┬╖ Assembly +$35 (20 min @ $95/hr, not added to drive time) !ΓÇÖ Total $130
+  Customer sees: Additional 20 Minutes ┬╖ Total 35 Minutes (15 included + 20).
+
+  Example 12 ΓÇö Everything stacked
+  2 chairs + 1 table (66├ù40) ┬╖ 22 min truck ┬╖ 2 flights ┬╖ Assembly +30 extra min ┬╖ 1 extra person
+  Route ~$110 ┬╖ Multi +$10 ┬╖ Large +$10 ┬╖ Stairs +$7
+  Assembly +$50 (30 min @ $95/hr ΓÇö separate from route time)
+  Note: if 3-person crew triggered, route becomes $130 base instead of $110.
+
+What customers receive
+
+ ΓÇó Thank you, [Name]
+ ΓÇó Preliminary Estimate: $XXX
+ ΓÇó billed at 95/hr (or 130/hr / two-truck variant)
+ ΓÇó Estimated drive time (truck-adjusted) ┬╖ round trip ┬╖ miles each way
+ ΓÇó Local truck travel time disclaimer
+ ΓÇó Optional: multi-item, large-item, heavy-item handling lines
+ ΓÇó Optional: disassembly/reassembly minutes (or within-15-min note)
+ ΓÇó Optional: confirm-with-customer banner if assembly > 60 extra min
+Pickup vs delivery: same numbers ΓÇö wording says consignor pickup or local delivery.
+
+Not included on local/pickup
+
+ ΓÇó Nationwide freight (different pallet/LTL pricing ΓÇö assembly affects range, not this sheet)
+ ΓÇó Raw Google/car drive minutes (internal only)
+ ΓÇó Per-item assembly questions on nationwide form (local/pickup uses job-level assembly question)
